{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"EST","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"以斯帖記","commonName":"以斯帖記","title":"以斯帖記","order":17,"numberOfChapters":10,"sha256":"3f0afbfe34e0084638d0b1ac327709f810abeef1484dca6738e75460e76004e1","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/EST/1.json","lastChapterNumber":10,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/EST/10.json","totalNumberOfVerses":166},"chapter":{"number":7,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["哈曼被處死"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["王帶著哈曼去赴以斯帖王后的宴席。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["在這第二次宴會中，王在席間又問以斯帖：「以斯帖王后啊，你要什麼？我必賜給你。你有何要求？就是半壁江山，也必為你成全。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["以斯帖王后回答說：「我若得到王的恩寵，王若願意，就請王把我的性命和我本族人的性命賜給我。這就是我的所求所要。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["因為我和我本族的人都被賣了，我們將被剷除、殺光、滅盡。如果只是賣我們為奴為婢，我會閉口不言，因為那樣的痛苦不值得來打擾王",{"noteId":1},"。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["亞哈隨魯王問以斯帖王后：「誰敢這樣做？他在哪裡？」"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["以斯帖回答說：「敵人和仇家就是這惡人哈曼！」哈曼在王和王后面前十分驚恐。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["王大怒，離席去了御花園。哈曼見王決意要懲罰他，便留下來求以斯帖王后饒命。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["王從御花園回到席上，見哈曼伏在以斯帖所靠的榻上，便說：「他竟敢在宮中當著我的面侮辱王后嗎？」王這話一出口，便有人蒙了哈曼的臉。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["服侍王的太監哈波拿說：「哈曼為那救駕有功的末底改做了一個二十二米半高的木架，如今正立在哈曼家裡。」王說：「把哈曼吊在上面！」"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["於是，哈曼被吊在他為末底改預備的木架上，王的怒氣這才平息。"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":1,"caller":"+","text":"「因為那樣的痛苦不值得來打擾王」或譯「但王的損失，敵人無法補償」。","reference":{"chapter":7,"verse":4}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/EST/7.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/EST/8.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/EST/6.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":10}